<p>Punk rock jesus manifests next to the beds of children from christian households whose parents believe they've sinned<br />
His appearence is exactly that of biblical Character of Jesus Christ, although his hair has been replaced with a large, black-and-purple dyed mohawk, and his beard has also been dyed the same color. He also carries a large electric guitar shaped like a cross.<br />
Once materializing, he'll sing a song to the child about their sins and the punishments satan has waiting for them.<br />
Once his song is finished, punk rock jesus will hug the child and remind them to pray every night before bed and &quot;stay rad&quot;</p>

